{"id":"223596","name":"香辣牛肉酱","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/223596/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"豆瓣酱","amount":"400克"},{"name":"干辣椒面","amount":"100克"},{"name":"花生米","amount":"一把"},{"name":"熟白芝麻","amount":"一把"},{"name":"花椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切成块。","img":"images/223596/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入料理机中搅碎。","img":"images/223596/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"姜切末。","img":"images/223596/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜切末。","img":"images/223596/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"花生米烤熟去皮，放入保鲜袋中用擀面棍擀碎。","img":"images/223596/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中倒入油，油多一些，放入牛肉末炒熟炒散。","img":"images/223596/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下姜末，干辣椒面和豆瓣酱翻炒均匀，炒出红油。辣椒面的量可根据个人口味调节。","img":"images/223596/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入适量花椒面炒匀、炒出香味。","img":"images/223596/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后放花生碎和白芝麻炒匀。","img":"images/223596/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"最后加入蒜末炒匀即可。","img":"images/223596/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/223596/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：食物调理机、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}